<div class="section-card" style="margin-top:20px;">
  <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:flex-start; margin-bottom:20px;">
    <div>
      <div class="section-card-title" style="margin-bottom:3px;">📊 최근 3개월 통계</div>
      <div style="font-size:12px; color:#aaa;">절약 금액 & 탄소 절감 추이</div>
    </div>
    <div style="display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:flex-end; gap:6px;">
      <div style="display:flex; gap:14px; align-items:center;">
        <div style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:5px; font-size:12px; color:#555;">
          <div style="width:10px; height:10px; border-radius:3px; background:#639922;"></div>절약 금액
        </div>
        <div style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:5px; font-size:12px; color:#555;">
          <div style="width:10px; height:10px; border-radius:3px; background:#1D9E75;"></div>탄소 절감
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="font-size:11px; color:#888;">통계기록은 임박 식재료 (D-3)에 한해서만 적용됩니다. </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div style="position:relative; width:100%; height:380px;">
    <canvas id="statsChart" role="img" aria-label="최근 3개월 절약 금액 및 탄소 절감 차트">최근 3개월 통계 차트</canvas>
  </div>
  <div style="margin-top:14px; font-size:12px; color:#5F5E5A; position:relative; display:inline-block;">
    <span id="co2-trigger" style="cursor:pointer; border-bottom:1px dashed #97C459; user-select:none;">
      CO₂ 계산 방법이 궁금해요 ⓘ
    </span>
    <div id="co2-tooltip" style="display:none; margin-top:8px; background:#173404; color:#C0DD97; font-size:12px; border-radius:12px; padding:14px 16px; line-height:1.9; max-width:360px;">
      🌿 음식물쓰레기 처리 회피 효과를 기준으로 계산돼요.<br>
      즉, 유통기한 3일 이내의 임박 식재료를 버리지 않고 소비했을 때<br>약 (소비 음식물량 × 배출계수) kgCO₂e/kg 을 절감하게 됩니다. <br>※ 배출계수 = 음식물 1kg 처리 시 발생하는 온실가스 배출량   </div>
  </div>
</div>

<script>
  document.getElementById('co2-trigger').addEventListener('click', function() {
    const box = document.getElementById('co2-tooltip');
    box.style.display = box.style.display === 'none' ? 'block' : 'none';
  });
</script>
    

<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chart.js"></script>
<script>
  const monthlyData = <%- monthlyData %>;
  const labels = monthlyData.map(d => d.label);
  const savings = monthlyData.map(d => d.savings);
  const carbon = monthlyData.map(d => d.carbon);

  const ctx = document.getElementById('statsChart').getContext('2d');
  new Chart(ctx, {
  type: 'bar',
  data: {
    labels,
    datasets: [
      {
        label: '절약 금액 (원)',
        data: savings,
        backgroundColor: ['#C0DD97','#97C459','#639922'],
        borderColor: 'transparent',
        borderRadius: 8,
        borderSkipped: false,
        yAxisID: 'y',
      
      },
      {
        label: '탄소 절감 (kg)',
        data: carbon,
        backgroundColor: ['#9FE1CB','#5DCAA5','#1D9E75'],
        borderColor: 'transparent',
        borderRadius: 8,
        borderSkipped: false,
        yAxisID: 'y1',
        
      },
    ]
  },
  options: {
    responsive: true,
    maintainAspectRatio: false,
    barPercentage: 0.4,
    categoryPercentage: 0.7,
    interaction: { mode: 'index', intersect: false },
    scales: {
      y: {
        type: 'linear',
        position: 'left',
        beginAtZero: true,
        suggestedMax: Math.max(Math.max(...savings) * 1.5, 200000),
        grid: { color: 'rgba(0,0,0,0.12)', drawTicks: false },
        border: { display: false },
        ticks: {
          color: '#bbb',
          font: { size: 11 },
          padding: 8,
          callback: v => v >= 10000 ? (v / 10000) + '만' : v
        },
      },
      y1: {
        type: 'linear',
        position: 'right',
        beginAtZero: true,
        suggestedMax: Math.max(Math.max(...carbon) * 1.5, 30),
        grid: { drawOnChartArea: false, drawTicks: false },
        border: { display: false },
        ticks: {
          color: '#bbb',
          font: { size: 11 },
          padding: 8,
          callback: v => v + 'kg'
        },
      },
      x: {
        grid: { display: false },
        border: { display: false },
        ticks: { color: '#555', font: { size: 13, weight: '500' }, padding: 8 },
      }
    },
    plugins: {
      legend: { display: false },
      tooltip: {
        backgroundColor: '#fff',
        titleColor: '#1a3a15',
        bodyColor: '#555',
        borderColor: '#e0f0d0',
        borderWidth: 1.5,
        padding: 14,
        cornerRadius: 12,
        boxPadding: 5,
        callbacks: {
          label: (ctx) => {
            if (ctx.dataset.yAxisID === 'y')
              return '  💰 절약 금액: ' + ctx.parsed.y.toLocaleString() + '원';
            return '  🌿 탄소 절감: ' + ctx.parsed.y + 'kg';
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
});
</script>